        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43589</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43589"/>
        <updated>2026-03-26T18:27:49.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR addresses the dev-docs-needed requirements of:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2022549" rel="nofollow">Bug 2022549</a> tabs.move() taking a list of tabs should unsplit a split view when its tabs are explicitly listed apart</li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2016751" rel="nofollow">Bug 2016751</a> tabs.move() does not move a tab to the specified index when the destination is part of a split view</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">In addition, it adds a section summarizing the features for working with groups and split views in the working with the tab API article.</p>]]></content>
