<p dir="auto">Updated the descriptions so that the next vertical line is always positioned according to the writing mode, independent of script direction.</p>
<p dir="auto">both <code class="notranslate">vertical-rl</code> and <code class="notranslate">vertical-lr</code> share:</p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto">LTR → top-to-bottom<br>
RTL → bottom-to-top</p>
</blockquote>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">vertical-rl</code> : lines stack to the left.</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">vertical-lr</code> : lines stack to the right.</li>
</ul>
