        <title type="html"><![CDATA[FF149 ShadowRoot referenceTarget and friends minor update]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43543</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43543"/>
        <updated>2026-03-24T07:09:59.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF149 added support for <code class="notranslate">referenceTarget</code> and <code class="notranslate">shadowRootReferenceTarget</code> attributes behind a pref. These are already mostly documented in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3711686776" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42323" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/42323/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42323">#42323</a>. This is pretty basic, but it was and remains about the right level because this isnt supported in releases or preview yet. At that point we should create guide material and cross link (this can be generated from the <a href="https://github.com/WICG/webcomponents/blob/gh-pages/proposals/reference-target-explainer.md">explainer</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">What this does is get us a little bit closer so that when we have to update there is less to do.</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Update the docs to use correct templates</li>
<li>Add linked individual property property docs rather than just the top level doc.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto">I have put a little bit more work into <code class="notranslate">ShadowRoot.referenceTarget</code> docs because it ONLY affects this property. So we could in theory add examples and so on to this without being confusing for other docs. See inline comments.</p>
<p dir="auto">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4080141592" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43453" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/43453/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/43453">#43453</a></p>]]></content>
